+---
+layout: page
+title: About
+---
+
+The Blue Lake Advocate is a community website for Blue Lake, California, inspired by the original *Blue Lake Advocate* newspaper (1888–1969). It's a place for town announcements, coverage of local events, contributions from residents, and a look back at Blue Lake's history.
+
+*(This page is a placeholder — full "about" content coming soon.)*
